  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gu Ye and Fang Yuan greet him in the discussion hall of Dark Flow Giant City together with Yin Liu Gong and Dragon Commander Ye Cha. He sits on Yin Liu Gong’s right, old and hunched, while death energy fails to hide the three men’s rank seven aura, and they are stationed in that city. He accepts Sha Huang after the door opens, notes that even Yao Huang once failed that door, and coughs as he speaks.",
      "chapters": [
        740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gu_ye",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_dark_flow_giant_city",
        "char_yin_liu_gong",
        "char_dragon_commander_ye_cha",
        "char_sha_huang",
        "char_yao_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He looks old and has a hunched back. He coughs as he speaks, showing an old and weak state.",
      "chapters": [
        740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Members soften toward Fang Yuan after hearing his words on the door, and Yin Liu Gong agrees that he is right before seating the new arrivals.",
      "chapters": [
        741
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "discussion-hall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He, Yin Liu Gong, and Dragon Commander Ye Cha take turns watching the Earth Trench entrance under the city.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "earth-trench-entrance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_earth_earth_trench"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Old Ancestor Xue Hu raids and leaves, the three rank seven immortal zombies standing guard can only watch him fly away and seek help from Zombie Alliance headquarters.",
      "chapters": [
        927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "xue-hu-raid-aftermath",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Eastern Sea reinforcements return, he, Yin Liu Gong, and Dragon Commander Ye Cha welcome the leader as the three currently in charge of Northern Plains Zombie Alliance. He and Yin Liu Gong ask to help in the counterattack. Later the three admit they failed to know someone had been hiding in Earth Trench.",
      "chapters": [
        929
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eastern-sea-return",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Blazing Heaven Demoness away from Northern Plains, the same three send at least one person to guard the Earth Trench entrance.",
      "chapters": [
        931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "earth-trench-watch-rota",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness"
      ]
    }
  ],
